<title>USA: Telechips CEO quits, company cuts workforce.</title>
<headline>Telechips CEO quits, company cuts workforce.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, NEV 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telechips Corp said that C.A. Burns has resigned as chairman, president and chief executive officer following the board's request the company hire a new president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Additionally, it said it cut its workforce by 50 percent.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to disclose how may jobs were actually being cut.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to name a new CEO shortly.</p>
</text>
